title: Adobe Commerce Magento StyleSmuggler Exploitation CVE-2026-75650
id: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d
status: experimental
description: Detects exploitation of CVE-2026-75650 (StyleSmuggler), an unauthenticated RCE zero-day in Adobe Commerce and Magento Open Source that abuses the template engine to inject PHP via Payment Transaction Failed Reminder email templates.
references:
  - https://threat-intelligence.redeyesecurity.com/blog/stylesmuggler-magento-zero-day-cve-2026-75650
  - https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/commerce/apsb26-58.html
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/09/09
tags:
  - attack.t1190
logsource:
  category: webserver
  product: apache
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - 'payment/transaction'
      - 'template'
      - 'email/reminder'
  selection2:
    sc-status:
      - 200
      - 500
  condition: selection and selection2
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate Magento transaction notification requests
level: high
